  "bodyHash": "QNsysY+b6VQ=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《变种怪物》将《我的世界》中的生物提升到了恐怖的新高度！与标志性生物的变异版本战斗，每种都拥有毁灭性的能力和独特的奖励。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">击败变种僵尸、变种骷髅、变种苦力怕、变种末影人等，每个都带来全新的挑战。制作强力物品，驯服爆炸性随从，并发现像蜘蛛猪这样奇怪的新生物。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">准备在生存无法保证的世界中迎接史诗级战斗和传奇战利品吧！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 特色变种生物</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧟‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变种僵尸</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一个拥有强力重击的庞然大物。击败它可获得强大的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">浩克之锤</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变种骷髅</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一个致命的射手。击败它可用其骨头制作</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变种骷髅盔甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变种苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：通过连环爆炸制造混乱。死亡时会掉落一个</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变种末影人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一个会传送的恐怖存在。砍下它的手可获得其力量，即</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">末影魂之手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">☃️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变种雪傀儡</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一个强大的盟友，能向敌人投掷巨大的冰块。</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">👾 仆从与伙伴</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：从</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">中孵化出的爆炸性盟友。使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从追踪器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可驯服并追踪它们。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕷️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蜘蛛猪</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一种快速且不可预测的生物，通过给吃了发酵蜘蛛眼的猪使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">化学X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">创造而来。</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 特殊物品</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">化学X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一种神秘的液体，能将生物变异为强大的变种生物或奇怪的新生物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">浩克之锤</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一把强力的武器，能猛击地面，击退敌人。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">末影魂之手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：从变种末影人处获得传送和方块操控能力。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕碎片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一种有毒武器，对地形使用时会引起爆炸。通过破坏</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">获得。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从追踪器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一种用于追踪和控制你的苦力怕仆从的设备。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变种骷髅盔甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变种骷髅骨头</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">制作强力盔甲。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">安装要求：客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge 均需）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 需）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 需）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模组支持，可直接在游戏内通过模组菜单进行配置（需要在 Fabric 上安装</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">开发）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，还需安装</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有配置文件均位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目录下，文件名称为</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有类型都存在于每个模组中，甚至可能根本没有。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衷心感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Shcott21</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他在多年前以</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mutant Creatures</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">为名首次发布了这个模组。大部分工作，尤其是所有精美的模型，都是由他完成的。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chumbanotz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Chumbanotz</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他率先通过其</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mutant Beasts</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组将变种生物带到了现代 Minecraft，为这次最终的复兴奠定了基础。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">非常感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tdstress\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">tdstress</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">重制了模组中的所有纹理，使其符合新的 Minecraft 艺术风格！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bag-of-holding\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ytones\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/ytones/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-chested\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
